-- title:
--   Exact ninth-row inverse polynomial P
-- statement:
--   The bundle gives 32 explicit rational real coefficients $a_i$ and defines
--
--   $$P(t)=\sum_{i=0}^{31}a_i t^i\qquad(t\in\mathbb C).$$
--
--   The complete coefficient vector is specified in the formal definition. The polynomial has degree at most 31 and supplies the exact algebraic data used in the validated ninth-row inverse argument.
